# sacrifices Soul-Guide Lantern with the dies trigger on the stack: "Exile each opponent's graveyard" exiles Aclazotz, so
# nothing returns. Bot1's graveyard is empty, Aclazotz is in exile and no Temple of the Dead is on the battlefield.

